WEBVTT

00:00:06.840 --> 00:00:08.918
Baby, carry on

00:00:08.942 --> 00:00:13.923
Ashita no kaze fuku goro ni

00:00:13.947 --> 00:00:19.929
Waratte yo namaikina mama de ite

00:00:19.953 --> 00:00:23.116
Akireru hodo

00:00:29.162 --> 00:00:34.532
Gamushara ni ikiteta mutekina jidai

00:00:36.336 --> 00:00:42.105
Totsuzen ni kuzureru yoru
mo aru keredo

00:00:43.076 --> 00:00:49.038
Kuchibiru natsukashii melody

00:00:50.116 --> 00:00:56.298
Koronda kizu ni ase ga shimiru

00:00:56.322 --> 00:00:58.300
Baby, carry on

00:00:58.324 --> 00:01:02.727
Mukai kaze fuku asa mo

00:01:03.329 --> 00:01:09.378
Waratte yo tsuki mo itsuka muite kuru

00:01:09.402 --> 00:01:11.380
Someday your journey will come

00:01:11.404 --> 00:01:16.619
Kiseki hitotsu kurai okoseru yo

00:01:16.643 --> 00:01:19.388
Sono hi made

00:01:19.412 --> 00:01:25.317
Don't you surrender! Angel Blue!

00:01:36.196 --> 00:01:40.376
Mistress Annette, you must put a
stop to that awful gang!

00:01:40.400 --> 00:01:44.713
They stripped me naked in the
town square at high noon!

00:01:44.737 --> 00:01:49.218
| had it worse! They took my clothes
off in a rowdy tavern!

00:01:49.242 --> 00:01:51.587
| want revenge!

00:01:51.611 --> 00:01:53.656
That gang interrupted my
wedding ceremony

00:01:53.680 --> 00:01:55.891
and stripped me in front
of all of the guests!

00:01:55.915 --> 00:01:57.726
The marriage was called off!

00:01:57.750 --> 00:02:00.463
My fiancé's parents forbid him
to marry someone

00:02:00.487 --> 00:02:03.115
who had been shamed in public
in such a manner!

00:02:05.859 --> 00:02:07.803
| share your pain completely.

00:02:07.827 --> 00:02:11.073
They dragged me into the bushes and
made me take my clothes off.

00:02:11.097 --> 00:02:13.156
I'm so embarrassed!

00:02:15.435 --> 00:02:17.746
Yes! We all are!

00:02:17.770 --> 00:02:20.740
Please, everyone remain calm.

00:02:21.441 --> 00:02:24.153
I, Mistress Annette, will make
sure that your troubles

00:02:24.177 --> 00:02:26.722
are brought to the attention
of Mistress Celcial

00:02:26.746 --> 00:02:28.190
To Mistress Celcia?!

00:02:28.214 --> 00:02:32.394
Mistress Celcia is very wise and
is chief among our elders!

00:02:32.418 --> 00:02:34.263
She will stop this insanity!

00:02:34.287 --> 00:02:36.031
Mistress Celcia can take care of them!

00:02:36.055 --> 00:02:37.766
Please, tell her about our troubles!

00:02:37.790 --> 00:02:39.656
You must! She will take the
problem into her hands!

00:02:40.193 --> 00:02:45.307
Mistress Celcia and I shall handle the
visitors from the other world!

00:02:45.331 --> 00:02:47.891
You must leave us now!

00:03:07.620 --> 00:03:09.064
Oh, worthy Bishops...

00:03:09.088 --> 00:03:11.147
Remain as you are, my dear.

00:03:12.125 --> 00:03:14.457
You seem to be exhausted.

00:03:16.930 --> 00:03:20.628
| did not realize that handling the
public affairs would be so taxing.

00:03:21.134 --> 00:03:24.013
Over three hundred elves have been
stripped naked by that gang.

00:03:24.037 --> 00:03:28.851
| hate to think how high that number
will rise if this continues.

00:03:28.875 --> 00:03:30.219
It's difficult.

00:03:30.243 --> 00:03:32.688
It's difficult to watch your fellow
elves be humiliated.

00:03:32.712 --> 00:03:36.792
But it's even more difficult
to lie to them.

00:03:36.816 --> 00:03:41.230
Why has Mistress Celcia abandoned
her place of honor and pride

00:03:41.254 --> 00:03:43.399
to help those awful visitors?

00:03:43.423 --> 00:03:45.234
You know the answer to that.

00:03:45.258 --> 00:03:47.903
Since she broke the restoration spell,

00:03:47.927 --> 00:03:51.625
Mistress Celcia feels responsible
for the whole crisis.

00:03:52.131 --> 00:03:53.809
Yes, I know!

00:03:53.833 --> 00:03:57.079
But she should also feel guilty for
helping them commit their crimes.

00:03:57.103 --> 00:03:59.315
Have you forgotten about that?

00:03:59.339 --> 00:04:01.501
The statue of Mistress Celcia?

00:04:02.141 --> 00:04:03.219
That's right.

00:04:03.243 --> 00:04:05.854
The statue that was created to
honor Mistress Celcia

00:04:05.878 --> 00:04:08.524
and her defeat of our mortal enemy,
the evil sorceress, Luffard.

00:04:08.548 --> 00:04:11.745
The three ruffians are certainly
powerful, but so was Luffard.

00:04:12.518 --> 00:04:15.598
If she could defeat that terrible witch,

00:04:15.622 --> 00:04:19.501
it should be easy for her to
destroy the visitors.

00:04:19.525 --> 00:04:24.206
Why has she become their slave?

00:04:24.230 --> 00:04:25.808
Well...

00:04:25.832 --> 00:04:28.677
| will ask that question to her face,
and I will not rest

00:04:28.701 --> 00:04:30.601
until Mistress Celcia has answered it.

00:04:31.404 --> 00:04:33.065
Annette!

00:04:36.042 --> 00:04:38.204
Thank you so much for the drink.

00:04:38.945 --> 00:04:41.414
Please take care of everything
while I'm gone!

00:04:43.316 --> 00:04:45.094
She's a righteous girl.

00:04:45.118 --> 00:04:48.520
| wish she was less head-strong
and tightly wound.

00:04:56.829 --> 00:05:00.809
We stripped fifty elves today and
not one success among them.

00:05:00.833 --> 00:05:02.745
This is so inefficient.

00:05:02.769 --> 00:05:04.780
At this rate, we'll be back
to where we were

00:05:04.804 --> 00:05:06.248
before Celcia started helping us.

00:05:06.272 --> 00:05:08.550
It's all Junpei's fault.

00:05:08.574 --> 00:05:09.385
What?

00:05:09.409 --> 00:05:10.052
Why did you have to dropkick
Ms. Celcia's crystal plaque? What?

00:05:10.076 --> 00:05:14.390
Why did you have to dropkick
Ms. Celcia's crystal plaque?

00:05:14.414 --> 00:05:15.891
Oh, come on!

00:05:15.915 --> 00:05:18.294
Whenever my TV back home
wasn't working,

00:05:18.318 --> 00:05:20.396
I'd give it a good kick and it
would work just fine.

00:05:20.420 --> 00:05:22.388
How does it look, Ms. Celcia?

00:05:23.623 --> 00:05:26.702
Not good. I've tried everything.
It's completely broken now.

00:05:26.726 --> 00:05:28.990
Ms. Airi, let him have it.

00:05:32.265 --> 00:05:35.565
A look of sorrow only an Oscar-winning
actress could summon.

00:05:41.107 --> 00:05:45.271
I won't do it again! I promise!
Please forgive me! I'm sorry!

00:05:50.249 --> 00:05:52.081
Faster, Mike!

00:05:53.753 --> 00:05:55.414
Hey! Wait up!

00:06:07.567 --> 00:06:09.345
Thank you, Ma'am.

00:06:09.369 --> 00:06:10.837
Hey!

00:06:13.773 --> 00:06:13.816
Come back!

00:06:13.840 --> 00:06:15.250
Okay, we have to go shopping now.
Come back!

00:06:15.274 --> 00:06:16.919
Okay, we have to go shopping now.

00:06:16.943 --> 00:06:19.241
Mike, you know where to
meet us, don't you?

00:06:21.714 --> 00:06:23.705
You are such a smart girl!

00:06:30.790 --> 00:06:32.835
What's up with that dog?

00:06:32.859 --> 00:06:34.327
Who knows?

00:06:38.498 --> 00:06:41.643
Celcia, you were never very
good at attracting dates,

00:06:41.667 --> 00:06:44.193
but I guess that changed
once you grew a tail!

00:06:45.304 --> 00:06:47.170
Shut up, you moron!

00:06:56.115 --> 00:06:57.583
Hey, wait!

00:07:00.019 --> 00:07:01.497
Ms. Celcial

00:07:01.521 --> 00:07:03.532
Ms. Celcial

00:07:03.556 --> 00:07:05.234
Let her go.

00:07:05.258 --> 00:07:09.571
She's probably going off to make
whoopee with that cute puppy.

00:07:09.595 --> 00:07:13.709
Well, I guess Ms. Celcia can
handle herself on her own.

00:07:13.733 --> 00:07:16.178
She is a sorceress, after all.

00:07:16.202 --> 00:07:19.729
So, Ms. Airi, I guess we'll handle
the shopping on our own.

00:07:21.574 --> 00:07:24.066
Ms. Airi? Ms. Airi?!

00:07:24.610 --> 00:07:25.888
What?

00:07:25.912 --> 00:07:26.088
Is something wrong?
What?

00:07:26.112 --> 00:07:27.375
Is something wrong?

00:07:29.549 --> 00:07:31.126
It's nothing.

00:07:31.150 --> 00:07:32.618
Let's go shopping.

00:07:46.065 --> 00:07:47.533
Mistress Celcial

00:07:48.401 --> 00:07:49.960
I'm so glad you are in good health.

00:07:50.636 --> 00:07:53.215
You look like you are holding
up well, Annette.

00:07:53.239 --> 00:07:55.918
How are you and the bishops?

00:07:55.942 --> 00:07:58.787
Fine. We are doing well.

00:07:58.811 --> 00:08:00.189
Annette...

00:08:00.213 --> 00:08:03.774
| get the feeling you did not come
all this way just to see my face.

00:08:07.954 --> 00:08:09.615
Why is it...

00:08:10.156 --> 00:08:12.601
Why do you go to such lengths

00:08:12.625 --> 00:08:15.604
to aid those who stalk our people?

00:08:15.628 --> 00:08:17.306
Well, I...

00:08:17.330 --> 00:08:21.289
| know you feel responsible for
breaking the restoration spell.

00:08:21.934 --> 00:08:26.615
But surely you are not blind
to the humiliation

00:08:26.639 --> 00:08:30.419
that elves have suffered at
the hands of those three.

00:08:30.443 --> 00:08:31.553
Yes, I know.

00:08:31.577 --> 00:08:31.920
They are clearly our mortal enemies!
Yes, I know.

00:08:31.944 --> 00:08:34.556
They are clearly our mortal enemies!

00:08:34.580 --> 00:08:39.228
Unfortunately, we do not have the
strength to defeat them in battle.

00:08:39.252 --> 00:08:41.630
But you do, Mistress Celcia.

00:08:41.654 --> 00:08:46.592
You possess the spell that defeated
the evil sorceress, Luffard.

00:08:48.661 --> 00:08:52.474
Annette, I have no idea what
you're talking about.

00:08:52.498 --> 00:08:54.309
| know the story!

00:08:54.333 --> 00:08:59.066
You deciphered the Ancient Text and
obtained the Ultimate Spell.

00:08:59.972 --> 00:09:02.784
Then, with that power, you
defeated Luffard.

00:09:02.808 --> 00:09:04.853
I've had enough of this, Annette!

00:09:04.877 --> 00:09:06.889
| don't know what the spell is,

00:09:06.913 --> 00:09:09.925
but I know it consumes 100 million
tons of magical energy when used!

00:09:09.949 --> 00:09:12.794
| know it is the most powerful
spell of all time!

00:09:12.818 --> 00:09:16.379
If you used it, those three would be...

00:09:16.923 --> 00:09:18.891
This tea is wonderful!

00:09:20.059 --> 00:09:22.838
Your senile old woman
act doesn't fool me!

00:09:22.862 --> 00:09:26.174
Annette, forget what you've
heard about that spell.

00:09:26.198 --> 00:09:28.310
That spell could bring the
world to an end.

00:09:28.334 --> 00:09:30.045
It is the most powerful and most
horrible spell of all time.

00:09:30.069 --> 00:09:32.347
Most powerful and most horrible?

00:09:32.371 --> 00:09:36.051
That's right. That's why
| sealed it away.

00:09:36.075 --> 00:09:37.953
That spell would mean doomsday
if it fell into the wrong hands.

00:09:37.977 --> 00:09:39.945
It must remain sealed away.

00:09:40.680 --> 00:09:42.858
You must forget about it, Annette.

00:09:42.882 --> 00:09:44.359
Forget about it?!

00:09:44.383 --> 00:09:46.828
Are you willing to allow our comrades

00:09:46.852 --> 00:09:50.165
to fall into the hands of these
terrible ruffians?

00:09:50.189 --> 00:09:52.734
Are you going to turn your back on
your people in their time of woe?

00:09:52.758 --> 00:09:54.036
Annette!

00:09:54.060 --> 00:09:54.236
Are these three strangers more
important to you than your race? Annette!

00:09:54.260 --> 00:09:59.207
Are these three strangers more
important to you than your race?

00:09:59.231 --> 00:10:00.208
Annette...

00:10:00.232 --> 00:10:00.709
Yes?
Annette...

00:10:00.733 --> 00:10:01.109
Yes?

00:10:01.133 --> 00:10:01.710
Yes? You must be weary
from your long journey.

00:10:01.734 --> 00:10:03.245
You must be weary from
your long journey.

00:10:03.269 --> 00:10:07.449
Please stay the night with us and
you can return first thing in...

00:10:07.473 --> 00:10:09.202
| hate you, Mistress Celcial

00:10:14.680 --> 00:10:16.148
Annette...

00:10:17.917 --> 00:10:21.285
| hate you. I hate you.
| hate you so much.

00:10:39.805 --> 00:10:41.316
| command thee!

00:10:41.340 --> 00:10:46.321
Sealed doors, make thy
presence known to me

00:10:46.345 --> 00:10:49.804
for I have made a covenant
with the ancient gods!

00:11:02.461 --> 00:11:03.905
Oh, yeah!

00:11:03.929 --> 00:11:07.593
I will do it! I am trained in
the magical arts too!

00:11:08.467 --> 00:11:11.528
This is the codex that contains
the Ultimate Spell.

00:11:12.371 --> 00:11:16.740
Thank goodness the Bishops could
tell me where it was hidden.

00:11:17.476 --> 00:11:19.154
Now, the battle is mine.

00:11:19.178 --> 00:11:21.237
Beware, fiends from another world.

00:12:09.862 --> 00:12:12.340
Ms. Annette, we can't thank you
enough

00:12:12.364 --> 00:12:15.243
for bringing us a new crystal plaque.

00:12:15.267 --> 00:12:19.848
We almost had to start from scratch
thanks to a certain karate nut.

00:12:19.872 --> 00:12:22.417
Who are you calling a nut?

00:12:22.441 --> 00:12:25.454
I'm simply following Mistress
Celcia's instructions.

00:12:25.478 --> 00:12:27.756
Hey, now that you mention it,

00:12:27.780 --> 00:12:30.358
why did that silly dog have to leave
without saying goodbye?

00:12:30.382 --> 00:12:32.350
Yeah, that is strange.

00:12:33.052 --> 00:12:37.319
Mistress Celcia was eager to get an
early start and ran ahead of us.

00:12:38.057 --> 00:12:39.889
That mutt is always up to something.

00:12:40.426 --> 00:12:44.206
This elf we're looking for sure
lives in a secluded area.

00:12:44.230 --> 00:12:46.842
| never would have thought
of looking up here.

00:12:46.866 --> 00:12:51.279
There's no way Mike could
make a climb this steep.

00:12:51.303 --> 00:12:53.148
We'll be there before you know it.

00:12:53.172 --> 00:12:56.802
According to the plaque, our target
lives at the top of the mountain.

00:12:59.345 --> 00:13:00.956
Thank you again, Ma'am.

00:13:00.980 --> 00:13:03.278
Hey, you! Come back here,
you damned thief!

00:13:13.826 --> 00:13:15.294
Stop!

00:13:39.084 --> 00:13:41.212
What the hell was that all about?

00:13:42.154 --> 00:13:43.622
| don't have much time!

00:13:55.234 --> 00:13:56.878
What's going on here?

00:13:56.902 --> 00:13:59.181
| don't see an elf or anything else.

00:13:59.205 --> 00:14:00.982
Shouldn't Ms. Celcia be here?

00:14:01.006 --> 00:14:04.186
Strange. She said she'd be here.

00:14:04.210 --> 00:14:08.306
Ms. Annette, it's time to come clean
about what you are doing.

00:14:09.315 --> 00:14:11.493
What are you saying, Ms. Airi?

00:14:11.517 --> 00:14:13.328
You knew no one would be here.

00:14:13.352 --> 00:14:16.583
Neither an elf nor Ms. Celcia.

00:14:17.456 --> 00:14:18.867
What makes you say such a thing?

00:14:18.891 --> 00:14:18.934
| doubt you realize it, Ms. Annette,
What makes you say such a thing?

00:14:18.958 --> 00:14:20.936
| doubt you realize it, Ms. Annette,

00:14:20.960 --> 00:14:24.123
but you have a habit of toying with
your earring whenever you lie.

00:14:26.699 --> 00:14:29.010
What the hell is going on here?

00:14:29.034 --> 00:14:30.729
We won't stand for being fooled!

00:14:31.937 --> 00:14:34.149
| guess I can end my
little charade now.

00:14:34.173 --> 00:14:35.784
Fiends from another world!

00:14:35.808 --> 00:14:39.554
How dare you go around humiliating
my elfin comrades?!

00:14:39.578 --> 00:14:42.390
| can't stand it anymore!

00:14:42.414 --> 00:14:44.993
You will not need to return
to your own world!

00:14:45.017 --> 00:14:46.951
I will lay waste to you right
here and now!

00:14:47.486 --> 00:14:49.648
You? Lay waste to us?

00:14:50.656 --> 00:14:55.337
Your jokes have gotten funnier
since we last saw each other!

00:14:55.361 --> 00:14:57.339
This is no joke.

00:14:57.363 --> 00:15:00.742
Naturally the three of you could
defeat me in a regular fight.

00:15:00.766 --> 00:15:02.825
But behold the codex!

00:15:03.369 --> 00:15:05.981
This is the Ultimate Spell that
Mistress Celcia deciphered

00:15:06.005 --> 00:15:07.282
to defeat our dreaded enemy!

00:15:07.306 --> 00:15:09.684
| will use it to send you to oblivion!

00:15:09.708 --> 00:15:11.686
The Ultimate Spell?

00:15:11.710 --> 00:15:14.789
That's right! And you have
no escape route!

00:15:14.813 --> 00:15:17.077
You cannot run from the devastation
of this great spell!

00:15:19.418 --> 00:15:21.696
You cannot escape, either!

00:15:21.720 --> 00:15:24.833
I'll test the speed of my fists versus
the speed of your spell!

00:15:24.857 --> 00:15:27.636
Alganard! Kass heychus!

00:15:27.660 --> 00:15:29.304
Est Peparhotee!

00:15:29.328 --> 00:15:31.206
Why, you little brat!

00:15:31.230 --> 00:15:33.074
Wait, Junpei.

00:15:33.098 --> 00:15:34.709
Okay.

00:15:34.733 --> 00:15:37.545
Hear me, great powers of the globe!

00:15:37.569 --> 00:15:39.748
The spirits that hide themselves among
the secret constellations!

00:15:39.772 --> 00:15:42.450
Heed my commands and
grant me my wish!

00:15:42.474 --> 00:15:44.386
This looks really bad!

00:15:44.410 --> 00:15:47.088
Shouldn't we be doing
something, Ms. Airi?

00:15:47.112 --> 00:15:48.790
Sweet little Ritsuko...

00:15:48.814 --> 00:15:49.791
Yes?

00:15:49.815 --> 00:15:50.292
If what she says is true,
Yes?

00:15:50.316 --> 00:15:51.693
If what she says is true,

00:15:51.717 --> 00:15:54.596
and this is the Ultimate Spell,

00:15:54.620 --> 00:15:58.181
then why hasn't Ms. Celcia
used it on us already?

00:15:59.658 --> 00:16:01.490
Well, now that you mention it...

00:16:02.628 --> 00:16:05.607
This is just my intuition.

00:16:05.631 --> 00:16:08.032
| have a feeling this spell is
not what she thinks it is.

00:16:11.670 --> 00:16:13.448
Stop it, Annette!

00:16:13.472 --> 00:16:16.751
How dare you recite this
horrible spell?!

00:16:16.775 --> 00:16:18.586
Do you want to destroy
the whole world?!

00:16:18.610 --> 00:16:20.522
Beyond light! Beyond darkness!

00:16:20.546 --> 00:16:23.311
Unleash thy powers of antiquity!

00:16:31.790 --> 00:16:33.668
Annette!

00:16:33.692 --> 00:16:37.505
| command thee with the
authority of this codex!

00:16:37.529 --> 00:16:40.508
Take hold of these foolish marauders
from another world,

00:16:40.532 --> 00:16:42.261
and annihilate them!

00:16:48.807 --> 00:16:50.639
My eyes!

00:16:52.211 --> 00:16:54.255
Farewell, Mistress Celcia.

00:16:54.279 --> 00:16:55.724
| will sacrifice myself to the spell

00:16:55.748 --> 00:16:57.648
as punishment for going against
your commands.

00:17:08.560 --> 00:17:10.028
What's this?

00:17:18.771 --> 00:17:21.282
This is just a summoning spell.

00:17:21.306 --> 00:17:24.640
But where did I summon
all of this stuff from?

00:17:25.978 --> 00:17:27.155
| knew it.

00:17:27.179 --> 00:17:27.455
Look at this, Ritsuko! Telephone
poles and vending machines! | knew it.

00:17:27.479 --> 00:17:30.425
Look at this, Ritsuko! Telephone
poles and vending machines!

00:17:30.449 --> 00:17:32.110
Oh, my God!

00:17:33.986 --> 00:17:37.932
Curry! Mild! Medium! Hot! Very Hot!

00:17:37.956 --> 00:17:40.301
Japanese style with extra large chunks!

00:17:40.325 --> 00:17:43.090
This one has the onions
cooked to perfection!

00:17:43.796 --> 00:17:45.992
This is the Ultimate Spell?

00:17:46.565 --> 00:17:48.033
That's right!

00:17:50.736 --> 00:17:52.347
Ms. Celcial

00:17:52.371 --> 00:17:54.149
Mistress Celcial

00:17:54.173 --> 00:17:57.452
During the savage fight with Luffard,

00:17:57.476 --> 00:18:00.755
| carelessly used this spell
and unleashed...

00:18:00.779 --> 00:18:02.657
| unleashed...

00:18:02.681 --> 00:18:04.740
Oh, no! What happened?!

00:18:05.717 --> 00:18:07.328
Where the hell am |?

00:18:07.352 --> 00:18:09.197
Ow! My head hurts!

00:18:09.221 --> 00:18:11.099
What just happened?

00:18:11.123 --> 00:18:14.769
Wow! Airi Komiyamal! I'm such a huge
fan! Can I shake your hand?

00:18:14.793 --> 00:18:17.072
Can I have your autograph?
Can I have a picture?

00:18:17.096 --> 00:18:18.564
Oh, I'm speechless.

00:18:19.431 --> 00:18:21.376
This is your Ultimate Spell?

00:18:21.400 --> 00:18:23.111
This is a mere summoning spell!

00:18:23.135 --> 00:18:24.279
Oh! Oh, no!

00:18:24.303 --> 00:18:24.612
I'll send you all to damnation!
Oh! Oh, no!

00:18:24.636 --> 00:18:26.581
I'll send you all to damnation!

00:18:26.605 --> 00:18:28.004
Take that!

00:18:29.675 --> 00:18:32.787
How dare you interrupt my introduction
to Airi Komiyama?!

00:18:32.811 --> 00:18:34.489
I'll see to it that you get an intimate
demonstration of karate!

00:18:34.513 --> 00:18:37.525
Oh, God! You singed my hair!
My precious hair!

00:18:37.549 --> 00:18:40.075
Prepare to receive a first-hand
lesson in modern weaponry!

00:18:44.656 --> 00:18:45.800
We won!

00:18:45.824 --> 00:18:48.486
<i>We won! We won! Banzai! Banzail</i>

00:18:49.661 --> 00:18:51.629
Who are these imbeciles?

00:18:53.699 --> 00:18:58.446
Yes, I am to blame for the arrival of
these three scoundrels!

00:18:58.470 --> 00:19:00.199
That's what all the fuss was about.

00:19:00.772 --> 00:19:02.917
What have you done, Mistress Celcia?

00:19:02.941 --> 00:19:05.433
This is truly the most horrible
spell of all time!

00:19:23.428 --> 00:19:24.896
Annette!

00:19:38.977 --> 00:19:41.689
Why? Why did you save me?

00:19:41.713 --> 00:19:44.239
| tried to kill you.

00:19:45.617 --> 00:19:49.281
| don't know. I acted without
thinking about it.

00:19:50.088 --> 00:19:52.167
Bear this in mind!

00:19:52.191 --> 00:19:54.669
We may strip elves of their clothing,

00:19:54.693 --> 00:19:56.559
but we never hurt them or
leave them to die.

00:19:57.629 --> 00:20:01.709
We know that our actions are
not polite or proper.

00:20:01.733 --> 00:20:05.713
If you know of another way,
please tell us what it is.

00:20:05.737 --> 00:20:08.001
We would gladly change our ways.

00:20:09.775 --> 00:20:13.221
We do not ask for your sympathy.

00:20:13.245 --> 00:20:16.224
But we want so badly to
return to our home,

00:20:16.248 --> 00:20:20.228
to our own world, to Japan.

00:20:20.252 --> 00:20:21.796
Junpei...

00:20:21.820 --> 00:20:23.298
Oh, Junpei.

00:20:23.322 --> 00:20:29.270
| understand now. You do not
humiliate elves out of malice.

00:20:29.294 --> 00:20:32.473
Of course, I cannot forgive you,

00:20:32.497 --> 00:20:35.577
but I do understand your plight.

00:20:35.601 --> 00:20:38.413
After all, humans and elves both
have hearts within them.

00:20:38.437 --> 00:20:39.905
Annette!

00:20:43.108 --> 00:20:44.576
Annette...

00:20:46.044 --> 00:20:47.512
Yes?

00:20:49.948 --> 00:20:53.612
We haven't checked under
those clothes, Annette!

00:20:54.519 --> 00:20:57.532
Don't be absurd! I don't have
one of the fragments!

00:20:57.556 --> 00:21:00.082
I'm not lying! Why would
I hide it from you?!

00:21:00.626 --> 00:21:02.185
Enough whining!

00:21:02.894 --> 00:21:05.073
Consider this punishment
for deceiving us!

00:21:05.097 --> 00:21:07.508
Contemplate your bad behavior
while you're naked!

00:21:07.532 --> 00:21:09.557
You are the cruelest man alive!

00:21:14.706 --> 00:21:16.584
The fish aren't biting today.

00:21:16.608 --> 00:21:18.052
Nope.

00:21:18.076 --> 00:21:20.135
Hey, look at that!

00:21:20.779 --> 00:21:22.645
What is that?

00:21:25.384 --> 00:21:28.696
| can't believe I felt sorry for him!

00:21:28.720 --> 00:21:30.965
Junpei Ryuzouji!

00:21:30.989 --> 00:21:35.426
The next time I see you, I'll have a
spell that will tear you apart!

00:21:52.678 --> 00:21:59.761
Yaru ki ga nai hi wa yasunda mo ii yo

00:21:59.785 --> 00:22:06.768
Jinsei wa nagakutte kimagure da kara

00:22:06.792 --> 00:22:13.841
Watashi wa anata o hyakubai ni dekiru

00:22:13.865 --> 00:22:17.111
Sore ja mou nechaimashou

00:22:17.135 --> 00:22:21.015
Sotto daitete ne

00:22:21.039 --> 00:22:26.000
Kyouryuu ni atta te

00:22:28.146 --> 00:22:34.762
Wa haha to warau, sonna hito

00:22:34.786 --> 00:22:41.469
Hana mo arashi mo hora
fumikoenagara

00:22:41.493 --> 00:22:49.143
Jidai ga kawatte iku kenai ga kikoeru

00:22:49.167 --> 00:22:55.817
Sui mo amai mo baby, kamiwakenagara

00:22:55.841 --> 00:23:03.841
Kujikenaide ne tensai wa
saigo ni kuru no

00:23:12.691 --> 00:23:15.303
Uh, oh! What did I just step in?

00:23:15.327 --> 00:23:17.638
| hate when I get that feeling
between my toes!

00:23:17.662 --> 00:23:21.642
| hate to look, but I can't
live in denial forever!

00:23:21.666 --> 00:23:24.192
What the hell? Spotted
dogs have guts!

00:23:26.037 --> 00:23:28.716
The next episode is a horror
story out of season.

00:23:28.740 --> 00:23:30.885
Next Those Who Hunt Elves:

00:23:30.909 --> 00:23:33.554
"Catch Me in a Field of Flowers"

00:23:33.578 --> 00:23:35.556
Be sure to check it out!

00:23:35.580 --> 00:23:37.048
Oh, that smells!
